1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Protein lene se pehle box ki photo nahi, label padho!

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Sirf 4 cheezein check karni hain.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Pehle serving size. Ek scoop kitne gram ka hai? Saare numbers isi scoop ke hisaab se likhe hote hain.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Dono mein 24 gram protein hai, par ek ka scoop bada hai. Protein ko scoop size se divide karo. Jitni zyada percentage, utna better.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Teesra, added sugar. Agar fat loss ya lean muscle goal hai, toh added sugar kam hona chahiye.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Ingredients mein jo pehle likha hai, woh sabse zyada hai. Aur agar extra amino acids add kiye hain, toh protein number sach mein kam ho sakta hai.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Aur hamesha FSSAI number, batch aur expiry check karo.

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Comment karo LABEL, main checklist bhej dunga. Nutrition Hub Khanna. Genuine supplements, sahi guidance.
